# solving differential equations
# input : P2 = f(x,P0) = P0'
# P4 = initial value ( x0) (normally : == 0)
# P1 = initial value ( == P0(x0)) (y0)
# P3 = initial polynomial (normally == x)
# example :
P2 = 1+P0^2
P1 = 0
P4 = 0

P3 = x
FUNC Picard : real,real >> real   # e.g. Picard(2,x)

P0 = Picard(N- 1,X)
ALG Pic

SPEC    Pic : Picard(0,X)=P3
ADDSPEC Pic : IF (N>0) Picard(N,X)= P1+I(P4,x,P2,x)
ADDSPEC Pic : IF (N>1) (X+Y)^N=(X+Y)*(X+Y)^(N- 1)

ALG Pica
SPEC Pica : (Pic;Real;Mulord;integr)
